# Discus

[[Play]]

[[Settings]]

[[Credits]]

:: Play
[after 2 seconds]
"You're a real loser. I hope you understand that you are perhaps, the most confounding barbarian I've ever had the displeasure of encountering. Our meeting is servant only to your fortunes, and what a sad affair they are."

[after 4 seconds]
You stifle a groan as you {glink: "Behind You", label: "make an about face for the man you know is behind you", lookAt: "/root/Start/Agamemnon", moveTo: "e:DeckCenter", clickLook: true}.

:: Behind You
"There is a sickness about you," Agamemnon continues, "a kind of stifling miasma. Certainly not compared to what the Discus was when it was blessed by the Gods. For your edification, Thor himself smashed {glink: "Mjolnir", label: "that very table", lookAt: "e:DeckLeft"} with his bare fists. And his hammer."

:: Mjolnir

[["There's no table there."->Mean]]

[["You make it sound so... exciting."->Mean]]

:: Mean
[JavaScript]
Interactions.cameraFocus("/root/Start/Agamemnon", true);

[cont]

"I aim to say that *warriors* once graced this hall. Now there is only you, and there is only me." He flexes one pec thoughtfully. "But I am mostly here to reminisce and despair over the sickness I am afflicted with. Hera turned my eyes towards perfection, made me covet glory unending, and see where her influence has gotten me." He eyes you up and down. "I am sure you will make a mediocre proprietor. Do me one last favor? {glink: "Unlock Door", label: "Unlock the door for my departure?", lookAt: [-20, 0, -14], moveTo: [-8, 0, -24]}"


:: Unlock Door

You move to unlock the door. Not even a second passes before you hear Agamemnon's [[anguished screams->Anguished Screams]].

:: Anguished Screams
[JavaScript]
let ag = new Character("Agamemnon");
ag.globalRotationDeg =  new Vector3(-90, -90, 0);

[cont]
"AUGH! OW! AHHH! OUCH! OUCH! OUCH! OUCH! OUCH!" A random smattering of objects can be heard clanging behind you.

All is quite for a half second, until you hear the screams again. "OUCH! OUCH! OUCH! OH NO! NOT THE ANVIL! NO! OW! OW! WOULD! YOU! STOP! THAT! OW! AEGISTHUS SAVE ME! ALMIGHTY- OW! ZEUS!"

You hear a {glink: "Dying Agamemnon", label: "long groan coming from behind you.", lookAt: "/root/Start/Agamemnon", moveTo: "/root/Start/Agamemnon"}

:: Dying Agamemnon
"Oh. I am dying. If only I had bothered to learn anything about Ancient Greece so I could make proper payment to... I want to say Charybdis?"

[["So sorry to hear."->Sorry To Hear]]

[["You were Mycenaean."->Mycenaean]]

[["There's no space for your dead body; you're going straight out the airlock."->Out the Airlock]]

:: Sorry To Hear
"Bleh. Bleh. Blah. Bleh." [[Agamemnon dies->Draw Chef]].

:: Mycenaean
"Oh!" Agamemnon smacks a dying limb against his forehead, "The payroll system was only localized for Linear A-" he takes a full minute to hacck up a lung. It's veiny and a little too full of itself. And blood. "I also couldn't figure out how to switch off of UTF 9." [[Agamemnon dies->Draw Chef]].

:: Out the Airlock
"Gag me with a spoon, sweet summer's child." [[Agamemnon dies->Draw Chef]].

:: Draw Chef
The substance holding Agamemnon together unravels into a loose collection of strands, tiny white threads. You reach to gather each. The torch is passed along to you, with the body of its proprietor. This is your restaurant, now.

Draw a Chef.

<form id="chef-draw">
<entity-draw id="chef-drawing" required></entity-draw>
<submit-passage-link class="link" to="Drawn Chef">"I have finished."</submit-passage-link>
</form>

:: Drawn Chef
[JavaScript]
let chefDraw = getForm("chef-draw");
chefDraw.get("chef-drawing").then(async (v) => {
    let img = await Interactions.saveSVG("chef.svg", v);
    let chef = await Interactions.createCustomCharacter("Chef", "user://chef.svg");

    let ag = new Character("Agamemnon");
    ag.globalPosition.then((gp) => { chef.globalPosition = gp.add(new Vector3(0, 1.0, 0)); ag.queueFree(); });
    chef.globalRotationDeg = new Vector3(0, 90, 0);
    Interactions.cameraFocus(chef, true);
});

[cont]
Ladies, Gentlemen, Astounded Onlookers, Creatures of Other Dispositions, step right up! Meet the Postmodern Prometheus. Stare in dumbstruck awe as they bring life to that which is dead! Flesh becomes substance, substance flesh. Agamemnon's body pulled and twisted into life anew, creating this being of your choice.

What will you call them?

<form id="chef-naming">
<input id="chef-name" required/>
<br/>
<submit-passage-link class="link" to="Named Chef">"Donezo."</submit-passage-link>
</form>

:: Named Chef

[JavaScript]
let chefNameForm = getForm("chef-naming");
let name = chefNameForm.get("chef-name");
let chef = new Character("Chef");
chef.characterName = name;

let actorOneIntro;
switch(actorOne.personality) {
    case "stooge":
        actorOneIntro = `${capitalize(actorOne.pronouns.subject)} slams into the metal of the Discus, letting the hollow <i>CLANG</i> ring out before speaking. "They call me ${actorOne.name}, professional Chef. And you seem pretty cool. I think. Don't rush me, I'm still figuring that out, actually."`;
        break;
    case "hothead":
        actorOneIntro = `${capitalize(actorOne.pronouns.subject)} throws a loose bit of metal shavings at you. "I'm ${actorOne.name}, your new Chef. Don't get on my bad side."`;
        break;
    case "goth":
        actorOneIntro (actorOne.personality === "goth") = `${capitalize(actorOne.pronouns.subject)} makes grim eye contact (or ${actorOne.pronouns.object} equivalent) with you. "You may refer to me colloquially as ${actorOne.name}. As long as you are not affiliated with any of my many enemies, I shall prove to be an adequate Chef."`;
        break;
    case "nerd":
        actorOneIntro = `${capitalize(actorOne.pronouns.subject)} regards you with some disdain. "Greetings and salutations. I am ${actorOne.name}, your new Chef, and I think we will get along fine."`;
        break;
    default:
        actorOneIntro = `${capitalize(actorOne.pronouns.subject)} extends a physical formal greeting. "The name is ${actorOne.name}, your new Chef. I look forward to working with you."`;
        break;
}
[cont]
{actorOneIntro}

[["Nice to meet you."]]

[["Don't talk to me that way."]]